  "authority_decision_text_exact": "SRC-001 CLOSED FOR CALIBRATION.\n\nI authorize closure of SRC-001 as the completed human-supervised\ndevelopment-calibration reference represented by the current immutable\nevidence state.\n\nThis closure is based on the completed whole-source consistency audit,\nwhich passed 1,670/1,670 checks, and the subsequent recovery and verification\nof the exact load-bearing B02-v1 checkpoint bytes.\n\nThe known unavailable file\n\nSRC-001-internal-audit-through-batch-06-20260805T1756+0200.json\n\nremains explicitly recorded as a visible non-load-bearing known absence and\nis not reconstructed.\n\nThis decision does not constitute:\n- a Loa-Aleph production run;\n- Loa-Aleph semantic validation;\n- sanctioned agent execution;\n- independent audit;\n- Précis acceptance;\n- golden-standard promotion;\n- accepted extraction criteria;\n- production readiness;\n- or v1 evidence.\n\nSRC-002 remains NOT AUTHORIZED.\n\nPreserve every prior proposal, decision, checkpoint, correction, receipt,\nattestation, frozen input, and recovered immutable artifact unchanged.",
